  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Кабинет как деловая переписка",
    "overview": "QabylDesk presents addressed authored packets as readable business correspondence. The owner-confirmed form uses the inherited owned cabinet identity: a navy account frame, pale ground, ink text, white native fields and a green explicit action. This is a working cabinet with quiet separators and direct labels.\n\nIts signature is the relationship between an index and a letter-like article. The recipient reads the authored sections before reaching the manual account note. Administrative forms and native disclosures use the same material. The typography, status language and restrained surfaces keep the packet, its version and the account action distinguishable.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
